OL,3,AGovernment's antisemitism adviser      
OL,4,Alaunches investigation into BBC        
OL,6,FThe government's antisemitism adviser  
OL,7,Fhas launched an investigation into the 
OL,8,FBBC over allegations of a "hostile work
OL,9,Fenvironment" for Jews.                 
OL,11,FLord Mann told BBC Radio 4's Today     
OL,12,Fprogramme he had decided to open the   
OL,13,Finvestigation "because there seems to  
OL,14,Fbe a growing feeling of discomfort     
OL,15,Famong Jewish staff".                   
