OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGovernment's antisemitism adviser      
OL,4,Alaunches investigation into BBC        
OL,6,FHe said: "If that's true, and that's   
OL,7,Fwhat I'm going to attempt to find out, 
OL,8,Fand if that is widespread, then that's 
OL,9,Fa really serious problem that has to be
OL,10,Faddressed. And I don't hear and see    
OL,11,Fthat being addressed, and at a senior  
OL,12,Flevel."                                
OL,14,FThe BBC said it takes "any and all     
OL,15,Fallegations of discrimination extremely
OL,16,Fseriously ` there is no place for it at
OL,17,Fthe BBC".                              
